Experimental extension maintained in the FrankRamm testing fork:
https://github.com/FrankRamm/MISC/tree/codex/universal-accel-homing

The extension adds generic configured-accelerometer backends, supervised
calibration/test/chart workflows, independent saved models, and transactional
installation/bootstrap support. It is intended for contribution upstream
after physical validation. The original Beacon algorithm is credited to
CloakedWayne; the testing fork does not claim upstream endorsement.

